	Annotations: bim:Definición "Declara que la pared está tendida con el ladrillo tumbado. El grosor del muro es la dimensión más grande del ladrillo. También llamado 'Érase una vez'."@es
	Annotations: bim:Definition "Declares that the wall is laid with the brick lying down. The thickness of the wall is the largest dimension of the brick. Also called 'Once Upon a Time'."@en
	Annotations: bim:CatRevit "[ OST_Walls : OST_WallCoreLayer : OST_WallsInsulation : OST_WallsSubstrate : OST_Parts ]"
	Annotations: bim:ClasseIfc "[ IfcWall ]"
	Annotations: bim:ABNT "[ 3E.14.02.02 ]"
	EquivalentTo: bim:é.uma.vez

